MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_001: Ugh. Dumped again. Why's it always like this?\nHang on...
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_002: Peter's talking to some girl... She's giving him\nsomething? A...a love letter?!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_003: That jerk, hogging all the good times! Makes me\nso angry!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_004: If we get the chance, sure. OK, bye.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_005: Hey! HEY! Don't let it go to your head, just 'cause\nyou got yourself a date.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_006: Dadao?! Date?! What are you talking about?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_007: Don't act like you don't know what I'm talking about.\nYou. The girl. The both of you!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_008: A boring little scab like you, getting a love letter from\na girl? No. No way!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_009: L-love letter? What do you mean?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_010: How long you gonna keep up the act, huh? Fork over\nthe paper she gave you.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_011: Ha! Bet there's all kinds of juicy details... Wait. The\nhell is this? A picture of...food?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_012: Y-yeah. It's a dish that girl's shop is famous for.\nShe said her father is the cook.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_013: So it's...not a love letter? It's just some sorta flyer?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_014: Yes! I don't know why you're talking all mean about\ngirls and dates and lovey-dovey stuff.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_015: Well, I'll be! Bahaha! Ya know, I figured it was\nsomething like that anyway.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_016: I feel better. And feeling better means I'm hungry.\nThat food looks tasty...
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_017: Hehe. That's a lot of tummy noise for just looking at\na picture. You like food, don't you, Dadao?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_018: Doesn't everyone? I mean, you stuff your face with\ngrub plenty too, don't ya?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_019: Heh. Kinda. I carry around a bag of ginji fruit in\ncase I get hungry. You want one?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_020: Whoa, these are pretty tasty. Wish I could share with\nmy little minions back home.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_021: M-minions? That's a scary word.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_022: Heh, yeah, they were some scrappy kids who loved\nme. It was really hard to come by food in the village.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_023: So I did what I could to provide for 'em. Stealing\nsandworm eggs and things like that.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_024: That sounds...interesting.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_025: We hardly had any food in my village. So if I so\nmuch as get a whiff of food, my stomach goes nuts.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_026: Well, we should try this shop together. We'll get a\ngood deal if we show 'em this flyer.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_027: Ooh, is that so?! Well, what're we waiting for, then?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_028: Let's order one of everything. We'll clean out the\nrestaurant in no time!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_C_029: I, um, don't think we'll have enough money for that.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_001: No, no. Don't worry about it. Alright. Bye.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_002: Peterrr! Did I just see you talking to cute\nladies again?!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_003: Dadao, it's not like that. I picked up something she\ndropped, and she was thanking me. That's it.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_004: That's all it was? You're so confusing, man.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_005: You're the one who keeps taking things the\nwrong way.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_006: Look, I just wouldn't be surprised if the ladies were\nafter ya.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_007: You used to be kinda soft, but now look at ya! You're\nextra fit.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_008: I've gotten leaner, sure. Food isn't always easy to\ncome by because of the fighting.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_009: Used to be I was always snacking on something.\nThose were good times.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_010: Er... You mean you didn't get fit like this to get all\nthe ladies' attention?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_011: No. Not at all. I'm not like you, Dadao.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_012: Well, that's just plain unhealthy if you're not eating!\nDon't you like food?!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_013: You should be eating as much as you want! No\nrestraint! What's the point of life if you can't do that?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_014: Take it easy! I can't help the way things are.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_015: The situation's got nothing to do with it! You're a\ngood guy, and you're always helping people out.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_016: People are grateful to you because you're looking out\nfor them. So you should be eating your fill!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_017: I'm...surprised you noticed all that. Thanks, I guess.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_018: What do you mean by that?! And don't thank me till\nyou've eaten.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_019: You wait here, ya damn fool. I'm gonna get some\nfood for ya.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_020: You don't have to do that! Where are you going?
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_021: Here, try these! They're the best of the best.
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_022: Delicious crunchy bugs I found over that way. You\ncan bake 'em, fry 'em—or eat 'em raw!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_023: Aah! I can't eat that! There's...too many legs!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_024: The sandworms back home were always my fave, but\nthese little crunchy guys are tasty too. Eat up!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_025: I have...somewhere else to be...right now.\nGotta run! Bye!
MID_SE_Pet_Dai_B_026: Passing up perfectly good food, eh? But they're so\ngood... Mmm, crunchy!